WP Scan - used for scanning vulnerabilities in webpage created by wordpress
  Command to use for enumeration
  wpscan --url http://10.10.67.25/blog -e vp,u
  -e = enumerate
  vp = vulnerable plugins
  u = users

  Command to crack password
  wpscan --url http://10.10.67.25/blog --usernames admin --passwords /root/Desktop/rockyou.txt

Command to find files
find / -name *.txt 
.txt = any extensions

